import Erdos126.Resolutions.Erdos126_132usd_25h

/-!
# Erdős problem #126: proof

Library root. It imports the primary resolution `Erdos126.Resolutions.Erdos126_132usd_25h`, the file
produced in the FrontierMath Erdős benchmark, which proves `Erdos126.erdos_126`.

The further resolutions in `Erdos126/Resolutions/` (`Erdos126_81usd_13h`, `Erdos126_104usd_15h`, `Erdos126_133usd_17h`) are
independent proofs of the same statement. Each is a self-contained copy of the benchmark
statement preamble followed by its own proof, so they are built as the separate library
`Erdos126Alternates` and deliberately not imported here.
-/
